<title>USA: Noland Q1 net rises, shr $0.17 vs $0.14.</title>
<headline>Noland Q1 net rises, shr $0.17 vs $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NOLAND CO</p>
<p>For the Three Months</p>
<p> Ended March 31			    1997*		  1996</p>
<p> Merchandise Sales		 $110,929,637	$106,239,797</p>
<p> Net Income				 637,531	     526,569</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share(A)			.17		   .14</p>
<p>* 1997 results have not been audited and are subject to year-end adjustments.</p>
<p>(A) Based on 3,700,876 shares outstanding in both 1996 and 1997.</p>
</text>
